  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inland Fishery Sector Assessments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this assignment is to conduct a comprehensive review and value assessment of the fishery sector. This involves detailed social assessment, sector performance assessment, review of integrated wetland livelihoods models as well as analyzing the fisheries sector potentials and opportunities. Also to strengthen the knowledge base for South Sudan?s fisheries sector to inform policies, legal and instructional frameworks, and upcoming operations.</narrative>
  </description>
